        "text": "# Fallback Label\n\nA **fallback label** is text you show when some data is missing or not provided. Instead of leaving a blank space, a fallback label makes it clear what’s happening.\n\n**Example:** If a user doesn’t enter their email address, the app shows `Email: Not provided` instead of leaving it empty.\n",
